  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To conduct a review of Globalt Fokus and MFA projects grants: 1) Pool schemes, 2) Claim Your Space, 3) Tech for Democracy. New prospective projects are being launched through Globalt Fokus in 2023 through the Digital Democracy Initiative and the second phase of Claim Your Space. For that reason, a review will be required. Last review was in 2018.</narrative>
